    (rel_date) [name: 'edx_when_userdate_rel_date_954ee5b4']
    (actor_id) [name: 'edx_when_userdate_actor_id_cbef1cdc']
  }

  Note: '''Stores a user-specific date override for a given ContentDate.

.. no_pii:

Columns from TimeStampedModel (abstract): created, modified.'''
}

